{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14104390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14104390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1410439001:0":{"text":"제발 케이든을 해치지 말아 주세요! 케이든은 착한 아이예요!","source_cn":"不要伤害凯登！他是个好孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486697EDCDFEF79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410439002:0":{"text":"가까이 오지 마세요! 이미 죄악화되었습니다! 모두의 안전을 위해...","source_cn":"别过来！他已经孽化了！为了你们的安全——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F1B922528A6749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410439003:1":{"text":"이게 다 느그 잘못 아이가?! 처음엔 베스비였다가, 인자는 케이든까지... 느그가 저래 만들었다 아이가!","source_cn":"都是你们的错！是你们害的！先是贝丝薇，又是凯登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0877928701B835F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410439004:1":{"text":"그 무기로 뭐 할라고? 목이라도 칠라고?!","source_cn":"你拿着武器，要做什么？是不是要斩下他们的头颅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306495E9358A91A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410439005:1":{"text":"살인범! 살인마!","source_cn":"杀人犯！刽子手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2896D7D024E2B776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410439006:1":{"text":"우리가 셀로클랜드에 얼마나 많은 희생을 했는데! 이건 아이지! 진짜 있는 거 없는 거 다 바쳤다 아이가! 근데? 와... 우리한테 돌아오는 게 꼴랑 이거가?!","source_cn":"我们为萨洛克兰付出了很多！不……我们付出了一切！然而这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB59E3B3ACAF059CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410439007:0":{"text":"소른 말이 맞아! 지식이랑 자원은 귀족들이 독차지하고, 우리는 온 힘을 다해 위로 기어올랐지만... 아주 사소한 일로도 바로 나락으로 떨어지지!","source_cn":"索伦说的没错！知识和资源被贵族们垄断，我们拼尽全力爬到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x766DD21D52342E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410439008:0":{"text":"우린 대를 이어서 시시각각 죄악화라는 위험에 직면해 있어! 이게 바로 우리의 숙명이라는 거야?","source_cn":"世世代代重复着所谓的命运，时时刻刻面临着孽化产生的风险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF9604E85912A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410439009:0":{"text":"여러분, 여러분의 고통은 이해합니다. 저 또한 평민 출신이기에...","source_cn":"诸位，我了解你们的痛苦。我也同样是平民出身……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x275DFEF74446402C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410439010:0":{"text":"허나, 지금 가장 중요한 것은 죄악화가 퍼지는 것을 막는 것이니, 어서 비키십시오!","source_cn":"但现在最重要的是阻止孽化蔓延，请让开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB428C355F6BCECDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410439011:0":{"text":"와... 진짜 환장하겠다! 우리가 와 그래 참고 살아야 되는데?!","source_cn":"我受够了！我们凭什么要承受这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF5391A298CFB04B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410439012:1":{"text":"케이든의 오늘이 우리의 내일이다 아이가! 이 살인마들, 우리 동족 손도 못 대게 단디 막아뿌자!","source_cn":"凯登的今日就是我们的明天！拦住他们，不能再让这些刽子手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x103EDCCD837D324B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民维克莎":{"text":"평민 빅샤","source":"平民维克莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:反叛的平民":{"text":"반란을 꾀하는 평민","source":"反叛的平民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:应声的平民":{"text":"옹호하는 평민","source":"应声的平民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民索伦":{"text":"평민 소른","source":"平民索伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":5}}